<title>EGYPT: Alexandria Pharma dividend 6.75 pounds/sha.</title>
<headline>Alexandria Pharma dividend 6.75 pounds/sha.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alexandria Pharmaceuticals and Chemical Industries will pay a 6.75 pound dividend per share for the financial year 1995/6, a company statement said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It said the dividend, decided after the company's annual general meeting on November 30, would be paid from December 29 at Banque du Caire. Dividends for 1994/95 were 6.18 pounds.</p>
<p>Alexandria Pharmaceuticals had said after-tax profit was 21.8 million pounds in 1995/96, up from 20 million pounds in the previous year. The years end on June 30.</p>
<p>Shareholders' portion was 13.50 million pounds - up from 12.37 million pounds in 1994/5 - for two million shares.</p>
<p>Shareholders' rights were worth 41.55 million pounds, compared with 35.46 million one year earlier.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
